From 205db713e7dc6c42a9e75779e9847cd93241cd43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:58:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ksld: don't lock automatically while connected to a trusted
 network

At home there is often no need for the screen to lock after a while, but
there was no way to say so. The Screen Locking page can now list Wi-Fi
and wired networks on which the idle timeout doesn't lock the screen.

BUG: 329089
